    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This is a delightful 3 bedroom semi-detached bungalow offering approximately 90 square meters of light filled and well appointed accommodation. Situated in a quiet, mature and settled development of just 18 bungalows positioned around a circular cul-de-sac overlooking a central green, this charming home offers peace, privacy and a wonderful sense of community.\r\n\r\nOriginally built in 1978 and tastefully extended in 2008, the property has been well maintained and improved to offer comfortable, modern living. Benefits include gas fired central heating, double glazed windows, a cosy log burning stove, insulated and floored attic accessed via a STIRA stair, and a C energy rating.\r\n\r\nInside, the accommodation features an alder wood fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, fitted wardrobes, attractive oak laminated wood floors and a recently refurbished bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, there is a double cobble lock driveway and beautifully landscaped east to west facing gardens with sandstone patios, ideal for enjoying the sun throughout the day.\r\n\r\nSuperbly located, the property is just a 5 minute walk from Donabate village and train station and a 20 minute walk from Donabate beach, with a host of residential and sporting facilities right on your doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch: 4' 6\" x 4' 2\"\r\nMosaic tiled floor. \r\n\r\nEntrance hall: 9' x  13'\r\nOak laminated wood floors, phone point, trap door to the attic.\r\n\r\nLounge: 12' 5\" * 12' 2\"\r\nFeature fireplace with a log burning stove, TV point, built in storage press, Oak laminated wood floor, view of the green, cove ceilings.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 21' * 9' 3\" \r\nAlder wood fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, Oak Lino flooring, sink, views of the garden, hob, oven, extractor fan, dishwasher, washing machine, fridge/freezer, door to the garden, TV point. \r\n\r\nBedroom one: 13' 8\" * 8' 9\" \r\nFitted slide robes, views of the rear garden\r\n\r\nBedroom two: 11' 8\" * 8' 9\"\r\nFitted wardrobes, views of the front garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom three: 8' 3\" * 7' 6\"\r\nViews of the rear garden\r\n\r\nBathroom: 8' 2\" * 4' 6\"\r\nWalk in shower with a glass screen, Electric triton t90i unit, WC,WHB, Windows, mirror, heated towel rail,  fully tiled\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nRear: East facing landscaped garden with sandstone patios, side entrance, tap, plug sockets. \r\n\r\nFront: Double cobble lock driveway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gas fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed PVC windows\r\nExtended kitchen\r\nInsulated and floored attic\r\nLandscaped gardens\r\nDouble driveway\r\nCul de sac location\r\nOver looking a green\r\n5 minute walk from Donabate village and train station"
      },
